OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 25 APR
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,9,     GTom Service with guests, stories
OL,10,     Gand the perfect classical
OL,11,     Gsoundtrack for the weekend. Tom's
OL,12,     Gguest is the mezzo-soprano Dame
OL,13,     GSarah Connolly.
OL,14,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,15,     GJools is joined by singer and
OL,16,     Gbandleader Rolf Stahlhofen.
OL,17,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,18,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,19,     GThe year is 1415. The Battle of
OL,20,     GAgincourt heralds a profound
OL,21,     Gchange in the sound of music.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
